# Aislix UI visual system (backend agents)

When any task touches UI, results presentation, dashboards, charts, KPI cards, or frontend copy:

1. Follow the locked Magic Pattern system in **aislix-frontend** `.cursor/rules/aislix-visual-design-system.mdc` and `aislix-chart-visualization-map.mdc`.
2. Do **not** invent chart colors, change KPI formulas, or fabricate metrics for demos.
3. Do **not** change backend calculations to "make charts look better."
4. Adjacent analytical cards must never share the same accent color.
5. Unavailable metrics → `Data unavailable` / `N/A`, never fake `0`.

Canonical tokens live in frontend `src/lib/ai-audit/kpi-palette.ts`.
